  <StepType>k__BackingField: 0
  <Id>k__BackingField: 5
  <Title>k__BackingField: "Thanh ni\xEAn kinh l\u1ECBch"
  <Description>k__BackingField: "Th\u1EDDi gian tr\xF4i mau tr\xF4i qua, ng\u01B0\u01A1i
    c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng c\xF2n l\xE0 n\u0103m \u0111\xF3 ng\xE2y th\u01A1 \u0111\u1EE9a
    b\xE9, Thanh ni\xEAn th\u1EDDi k\xEC c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u01A1i...?"
  <Groups>k__BackingField:
  - <Id>k__BackingField: 23
    <StatOptions>k__BackingField:
    - <Id>k__BackingField: 44
      <Name>k__BackingField: "Th\u1EA3m tao t\u1EEB h\xF4n"
