      <Description>k__BackingField: "B\u1EDFi v\xEC tu luy\u1EC7n qua m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt
        b\u1EA5t nh\u1EADp l\u01B0u ph\xE0m nh\xE2n khinh c\xF4ng v\xF5 h\u1ECDc
